pliances, and third-party gift cards. Additionally, it operates digital payment platforms; offers financial services and related products, including money transfers, bill payments, money orders, check cashing, prepaid access, co-branded credit cards, installment lending, and earned wage access; and markets lines of merchandise under private and licensed brands. The company was formerly known as Wal-Mart Stores, Inc. and changed its name to Walmart Inc. in February 2018. Walmart Inc. was founded in 1945 and is based in Bentonville, Arkansas.","web":"https://www.stock.walmart.com","empleados":2100000.0,"precio_bloque":{"precio":125.5199966430664,"r1m":0.13531113797776873,"r3m":0.11681599152281485,"r6m":-0.03534077323277962,"r12m":0.2474309324737778,"ytd":0.12024936954230903,"r12m_spy":0.09687826954781587,"mom12_1":0.09875688764554735,"vs_ma200":0.060470136062034774,"max52":133.87948608398438,"vs_max52":-0.062440405811491906,"vol1y":0.26863835885780935,"beta":0.4857072705015901,"caida_max_5y":-0.2573966957582323,"serie":{"f":["2021-11-12","2021-11-19","2021-11-26","2021-12-03","2021-12-10","2021-12-17","2021-12-24","2021-12-31","2022-01-07","2022-01-14","2022-01-21","2022-01-28","2022-02-04","2022-02-11","2022-02-18","2022-02-25","2022-03-04","2022-03-11","2022-03-18","2022-03-25","2022-04-01","2022-04-08","2022-04-15","2022-04-22","2022-04-29","2022-05-06","2022-05-13","2022-05-20","2022-05-27","2022-06-03","2022-06-10","2022-06-17","2022-06-24","2022-07-01","2022-07-08","2022-07-15","2022-07-22","2022-07-29","2022-08-05","2022-08-12","2022-08-19","2022-08-26","2022-09-02","2022-09-09","2022-09-16","2022-09-23","2022-09-30","2022-10-07","2022-10-14","2022-10-21","2022-10-28","2022-11-04","2022-11-11","2022-11-18","2022-11-25","2022-12-02","2022-12-09","2022-12-16","2022-12-23","2022-12-30","2023-01-06","2023-01-13","2023-01-20","2023-01-27","2023-02-03","2023-02-10","2023-02-17","2023-02-24","2023-03-03","2023-03-10","2023-03-17","2023-03-24","2023-03-31","2023-04-07"